note as LEDGER_diagram_16_accounting
  Posted journal transactions and ledger entries are append-only and balanced.
  Corrections use reversal and replacement transactions; UPDATE/DELETE are denied.
end note

note as DERIVED_diagram_16_accounting
  Balances and financial statements are derived views/read models, never mutable
  source-of-truth columns.
end note

